---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'SilverTech Directory Manifesto | About';
const description = 'The SilverTech Directory manifesto: ending the transparency tax in senior care and restoring direct, data-first decision making for families and operators.';
const canonical = 'https://silvertechdirectory.com/about/';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://silvertechdirectory.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About', item: canonical },
  ],
};

const articleSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'The SilverTech Directory Manifesto',
  description,
  url: canonical,
  datePublished: '2026-03-19',
  dateModified: '2026-03-19',
  author: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'SilverTech Directory',
  },
  publisher: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'SilverTech Directory',
    url: 'https://silvertechdirectory.com',
    logo: {
      '@type': 'ImageObject',
      url: 'https://silvertechdirectory.com/logo-nav.png',
    },
  },
};
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)}></script>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)}></script>

  <div class="container manifesto-page">
    <nav class="manifesto-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>About</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="manifesto-hero">
      <p class="manifesto-kicker">The SilverTech Directory Manifesto</p>
      <h1>The Era of the Information Hostage Is Over</h1>
      <p class="manifesto-deck">
        Families deserve direct facts, not hidden pricing and referral funnels. SilverTech exists to set a new
        baseline for senior care transparency.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="manifesto-section">
      <h2>1. The Transparency Tax</h2>
      <p>
        For too long, senior care has operated inside a black box. Referral agencies and corporate operators normalized
        hiding room and board pricing, staffing levels, and real-time availability.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is not competitive strategy. It is a tax on honesty. When information is hidden, families are forced
        through intermediaries who charge facilities thousands just to pass along a lead that should have been direct.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is not efficiency. It is extraction.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto-section">
      <h2>2. The Generational Shift</h2>
      <p>The next generation of decision-makers does not browse the same way. They evaluate with hard filters:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Data instead of sales language</li>
        <li>Pricing instead of "call for details"</li>
        <li>Direct access instead of referral funnels</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Transparency is no longer a feature. It is baseline credibility. Facilities that hide foundational information
        are removing themselves from consideration.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto-section">
      <h2>3. SilverTech Restores Control</h2>
      <p>
        SilverTech is built on a single operating principle: the operator closest to the resident should control the
        relationship. Not a call center. Not a referral broker.
      </p>
      <div class="manifesto-grid">
        <article class="manifesto-card">
          <h3>Room and Board Standard</h3>
          <p>Facilities publish base pricing so families arrive informed and tours convert without price shock.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="manifesto-card">
          <h3>Staffing Proof</h3>
          <p>Care is demonstrated through real operational signals, not soft marketing language.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="manifesto-card">
          <h3>Direct Access</h3>
          <p>Families connect directly with facilities with no gatekeepers, commissions, or lead resale.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="manifesto-strong">This is not a feature set. It is a correction.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto-section">
      <h2>4. Built for the Underdog</h2>
      <p>
        SilverTech exists for operators who deliver real care but refuse to participate in referral systems that
        extract tens of thousands of dollars per year.
      </p>
      <p>When information is open, good operators compete on quality, not referral contracts or marketing spend.</p>
      <p class="manifesto-strong">Truth rises.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto-section">
      <h2>Industry Report Card</h2>
      <div class="manifesto-table-wrap">
        <table class="manifesto-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>The Old Model (Pay-to-Play)</th>
              <th>The SilverTech Model (Direct)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Hidden pricing</td>
              <td>Room and board disclosed</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>"Call for availability"</td>
              <td>Live availability signals</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Commission per move-in</td>
              <td>$0 direct connection</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Lead ownership by third party</td>
              <td>Relationship owned by facility</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Marketing-driven placement</td>
              <td>Data-driven decisions</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto-cta">
      <p>
        This page is our standard: philosophy, operator signal, and public accountability statement in one place.
      </p>
      <div class="manifesto-actions">
        <a href="/search/" class="btn-primary">Search the Directory</a>
        <a href="/badges/" class="btn-secondary">View Badge Standards</a>
        <a href="/why-this-exists/" class="btn-secondary">Read Why This Exists</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .manifesto-page {
    max-width: 920px;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .manifesto-breadcrumbs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .manifesto-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f172a, #1e293b 48%, #334155);
    border-radius: 16px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 2.1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #facc15;
  }

  .manifesto-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
  }

  .manifesto-deck {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .manifesto-section {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .manifesto-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
    color: #111827;
  }

  .manifesto-section p {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #334155;
  }

  .manifesto-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem 1.2rem;
    padding: 0;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .manifesto-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0.9rem 0 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  }

  .manifesto-card {
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    background: #fffbeb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .manifesto-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #78350f;
  }

  .manifesto-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #92400e;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .manifesto-strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .manifesto-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .manifesto-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 580px;
  }

  .manifesto-table th,
  .manifesto-table td {
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .manifesto-table th {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .manifesto-cta {
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .manifesto-cta p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .manifesto-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .btn-primary,
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #111827;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #0f172a;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
    color: #1e293b;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #334155;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
</style>
